    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d274-f1" n="1" xml:id="d274-f1-content">
                <p>With respect to NSC Action No. 443, see footnote
                    8, <ref target="#pg1879">p. 1879</ref>. Extracts from NSC 104, February 12, are printed on <ref target="#pg1902">p.
                        1902</ref>. The remaining references here deal with broader East-West trade
                    issues; for documentation, see <ref target="frus1951v01#pg_993">vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>, pp. 993</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
